PartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有不小心發生錯誤的時候，不需要取笑別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-22","sourceFront":"取笑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，有人說夏天開冷氣不如開除溼機，不過有專家表示，它們的功能無法互相取代。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-22","sourceFront":"除溼機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"主管的責任之一是幫員工爭取更好的福利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-02","sourceFront":"爭取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A captive's torn 耳(ear) is seized firmly in a victor's 又(hand) as spoils to claim and 取(take)."},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-03\",\"撿\",\"撿\",\"捡\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在路上撿到錢包可以交給警察，請他們幫忙處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-03","sourceFront":"撿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-04\",\"大街\",\"大街\",\"大街\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次颱風雨大風又強，大街上不少店家都關店休息。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-04","sourceFront":"大街","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-10\",\"電線\",\"電線\",\"电线\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"颱風過後，很多電線被強風吹壞了，需要幾天才能恢復正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-10","sourceFront":"電線","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-23\",\"大腦\",\"大腦\",\"大脑\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"人類大腦分成幾區，有的管語言，有的管記憶，很有意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-23","sourceFront":"大腦","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"路教授最近發表的這套跟人體大腦有關的理論，令其他科學家很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-45","sourceFront":"套","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-2-07\",\"场\",\"場\",\"场\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從我家到機場也不遠，開車去、坐捷運去都可以。","pinyin":"Cóng wǒ jiā dào jīchǎng yě bù yuǎn, kāichē qù, zuò jiéyùn qù dōu kěyǐ.","english":"It is not far from my house to the airport. I can go by car or MRT.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"機場附近的風景也很漂亮，我常常去看風景、看飛機。","pinyin":"Jīchǎng fùjìn de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliang, wǒ chángcháng qù kàn fēngjǐng, kàn fēijī.","english":"The scenery near the airport is beautiful; I often go there to see the view and watch the planes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"（看地圖）啊！天美飯店在這裡！我知道這個地方，附近有郵局跟超級市場。","pinyin":"(Kàn dìtú) A! Tiānměi Fàndiàn zài zhèlǐ! Wǒ zhīdào zhè ge dìfang, fùjìn yǒu yóujú gēn chāojíshìchǎng.","english":"(Looking at the map) Ah! So here is Tianmei Hotel! I know this place. There is a post office and a supermarket nearby.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-49\",\"合不來\",\"合不來\",\"合不来\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我跟他的個性、想法都合得來，就是飲食習慣合不來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-49","sourceFront":"合不來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-17\",\"支出\",\"支出\",\"支出\",\"Vpt/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我習慣把每一筆支出都記錄起來，提醒自己少花點兒錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-17","sourceFront":"支出","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"印\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 卩(seal) presses the page → 印(print)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"國中\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 國(country) and 中(middle): 國中 means junior high school."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"異\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 田(field) 共(shared) by many is seen 異(different) by each."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"聰\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"an 耳(ear) leans beside a 囪(chimney) as a keen 心(heart) listens → quick and 聰(sharp)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"議\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Gathering spoken 言(speech) together to uphold moral 義(justice) guides leaders to 議(consult)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"走\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"The open 土(earth) under a 龰(foot) → off to 走(walk) now."}]}
